ent approach in determining its operating segments. The Company’s CODM is identified as the Chief Executive Officer, relies upon the consolidated results of operations as a whole when making decisions about allocating resources and assessing the performance of the Company. The Company generates substantially all of its revenue from the Chinese mainland and Taiwan, China, and the majority of the Company’s long-lived assets were located in the Mainland China. As a result of the assessment made by CODM, the Company has only one reportable segment. The Group does not distinguish between markets or segments for the purpose of internal reporting.","section":"Business Reorganization","block":1716,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001731122-26-000625","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-29","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001941506","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1941506/000173112226000625/e7578_20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/4244fd86921c33bca2942e33a2329f4cc039333aedb9b7298f393337f7738268.bin","sha256":"4244fd86921c33bca2942e33a2329f4cc039333aedb9b7298f393337f7738268"}},{"id":"48c42fdbbceb4a6a092019e07f0a4b2c59a0330f05f6fb5682c6727e508c87c4","quote":"21.SHARE-BASED COMPENSATION","context":"There have been no changes to the overall basis of segmentation or the measurement basis for the segment results since the prior year.","section":"Business Reorganization","block":1719,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001731122-26-000625","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-29","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001941506","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1941506/000173112226000625/e7578_20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/4244fd86921c33bca2942e33a2329f4cc039333aedb9b7298f393337f7738268.bin","sha256":"4244fd86921c33bca2942e33a2329f4cc039333aedb9b7298f393337f7738268"}}],"omittedEvi